    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"professional\" talk feels so hollow though. i'm not just sad, i feel like the very logic of my life has been deleted. if the things that gave me purpose were based on a total delusion, then \"i\" don't even exist anymore. i'm just a shell. how can anyone find \"support\" for someone who isn't even really there? it feels like there's no way to even start over when the very concept of meaning feels like a joke.",
