    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no ground. that's the thing. you talk about building something new, but there's just nothing there. just an endless, dark void. it's like everything that was supposed to hold me up was just a hallucination. if there's no truth, no structure, and no point... why does it even matter if i keep struggling to stand up in a vacuum? isn't it more honest to just accept that it's all over?",
